# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the tests of PBeFS.
#
# In blocking mode, the load balancer of a FastFlow farm allocates with
# malloc() the mutex and the condition variable on which its input waits,
# and never frees them; FarmAStar uses the blocking mode when the CPUs are
# fewer than its threads, as on the small runners of the CI. Only that
# allocation of FastFlow is suppressed.
leak:ff::ff_loadbalancer::init_input_blocking
